**Ziyutec**:\n\n### Overview\nZiyutec is an organization that conducts **construction budgeting and
electrical design training**, particularly focusing on practical aspects of electrical engineering
in construction projects. Their training programs are designed to provide hands-on knowledge and
real-world application, including detailed budgeting and project management.\n\n---\n\n### Key
Services and Focus Areas\n\n1. **Construction Budgeting for Electrical Design Training**:\n   -
